/mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math> .<br /><br />So equation of the Normal would be <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />It passes through&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
